  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pahy](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pahy) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jan 31 2025 42km NW of Tena. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -0.8239 longitude -78.1491. It impacted 160248 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
